@info

Despite my best efforts, this mod definitely strains believability at times. Some of the music or images may be anachronistic. The KPD's actions(under your control) will likely deviate significantly from OTL, impossibly so in some cases. The credits are also not done, music is likely buggy, advisors aren't done, and elections aren't done. Much is to be done.

